  "legalBasis": "Release materials preserve the license notices and corresponding source/build materials of the linked Android ELF libraries. Exact unchanged ELF members retain the previous approved corresponding materials. SQLite C is public domain; the exact official source URL, source ID and SHA-256/SHA3-256 are recorded, and the complete MIT Dart wrapper/build recipe is included.",
  "findings": [
    "Ten non-app ARM64 ELF members independently verified. Five are byte-identical to their previously approved members.",
    "ASS 0.5.1 and Jellyfin Media3 FFmpeg 1.9.0+1 members are byte-identical to their official pinned AAR members; all 19 ASS ABI symbols required by the wrapper resolve.",
    "Packaged Flutter engine and SQLite match the official ARM64 artifacts after reproduction with the pinned NDK r28c strip tool.",
    "The APK excludes the MDK native libraries and the FvpPlugin DEX marker. The Android notices bytes equal the exact frozen application source blob.",
    "Sensitive-data screening and device acceptance are separate from this source/native review."
  ],
